    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "```suggestion\r\n  rootTagName: keyof JSX.IntrinsicElements | Fragment;\r\n```\r\n\r\nI can get this working if I change the defaultProps FYI. I don' think it matters much, but in case you want it:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/Template.tsx b/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/Template.tsx\r\nindex 796dfd127..70f2531d9 100644\r\n--- a/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/Template.tsx\r\n+++ b/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/Template.tsx\r\n@@ -22,9 +22,11 @@ class RawHtml extends Component<{ content: string }> {\r\n   }\r\n }\r\n \r\n+type TagName = keyof JSX.IntrinsicElements | typeof Fragment;\r\n+\r\n const defaultProps = {\r\n   data: {},\r\n-  rootTagName: 'div',\r\n+  rootTagName: 'div' as TagName,\r\n   useCustomCompileOptions: {},\r\n   templates: {},\r\n   templatesConfig: {},\r\n@@ -33,7 +35,7 @@ const defaultProps = {\r\n export type TemplateProps = {\r\n   data?: Record<string, any>;\r\n   rootProps?: Record<string, any>;\r\n-  rootTagName: keyof JSX.IntrinsicElements | 'fragment';\r\n+  rootTagName: TagName;\r\n   templateKey: string;\r\n   bindEvent?: BindEventForHits;\r\n   sendEvent?: SendEventForHits;\r\n@@ -69,8 +71,7 @@ See: https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/building-search-ui/upgrade-guides/js/#up\r\n       );\r\n     }\r\n \r\n-    const RootTagName =\r\n-      this.props.rootTagName === 'fragment' ? Fragment : this.props.rootTagName;\r\n+    const RootTagName = this.props.rootTagName;\r\n \r\n     const useCustomCompileOptions =\r\n       this.props.useCustomCompileOptions[this.props.templateKey];\r\ndiff --git a/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/__tests__/Template-test.tsx b/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/__tests__/Template-test.tsx\r\nindex ef3b246c5..f6c4603f0 100644\r\n--- a/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/__tests__/Template-test.tsx\r\n+++ b/packages/instantsearch.js/src/components/Template/__tests__/Template-test.tsx\r\n@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@\r\n \r\n import { mount, shallow } from '@instantsearch/testutils/enzyme';\r\n import { render } from '@testing-library/preact';\r\n-import { h } from 'preact';\r\n+import { Fragment, h } from 'preact';\r\n \r\n import { warning } from '../../../lib/utils';\r\n import Template from '../Template';\r\n@@ -58,7 +58,7 @@ describe('Template', () => {\r\n \r\n   it('can have Fragment as rootTagName with string template', () => {\r\n     const props = getProps({\r\n-      rootTagName: 'fragment',\r\n+      rootTagName: Fragment,\r\n       templates: { test: '<span>test</span>' },\r\n     });\r\n     const wrapper = render(<Template {...props} />);\r\n@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@ describe('Template', () => {\r\n \r\n   it('can have Fragment as rootTagName with Preact template', () => {\r\n     const props = getProps({\r\n-      rootTagName: 'fragment',\r\n+      rootTagName: Fragment,\r\n       templates: { test: () => <span>test</span> },\r\n     });\r\n     const wrapper = render(<Template {...props} />);\r\n```",
